@PORT@ is compatible with built-in CMake variables. In case of multiple OpenCV version installed, set OpenCV_ROOT *before* the find_package call:

    set(OpenCV_ROOT "${VCPKG_INSTALLED_DIR}/@TARGET_TRIPLET@/share/@PORT@")
    find_package(OpenCV REQUIRED)

The Snow Apps overlay enables OPENCV_DNN_SNOW_SHOT_QR. Its DNN factory supports
the pinned WeChat detector and super-resolution graphs, plus Net output aliases;
it does not register unrelated neural-network layers. OpenCV_SNOW_SHOT_QR_PROFILE
advertises this contract to the model tests. Update and run those tests whenever
the bundled QR models or this registration profile changes.
